hythm or meter slightly in order to make the poem flow more naturally in the target language.","wo":"Yenn saa, fàww ma xawa jekkal ritm bi ak meetar bi tuuti ngir taalif di mën di jàll bu baax ba melni ci làkk wiñ ko tekki lañu ko bindee.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYenn saa faw ma khawa diekkal rythme bi ak mètre bi touti nguir taalif di meun di diall bou bakh ba melni ci lakk wign ko tekki lagnou ko bindé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1927,"row":{"en":"But then I clicked on it, and it took me to this website that looked really official, and it said that I needed to download this software to fix the virus.","wo":"Waaye ma daal di ci klikee, mu yóbbu ma ci setweb bu nuru lu baax te wóor, muni ma dama wara yebbi losisel bi ngir ray virus bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé ma daldi si cliké, mou yobou ma si setweb bou nourou lou bakh té woor, mouni ma dama wara yébi logiciel bi nguir ray virus bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1928,"row":{"en":"Treatment options depend on the duration or frequency of ear symptoms.","wo":"Pajum feebaru nopp a ngi aju yàggaay bi ak bariwaay bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nPadjoum febbarou nopp angi adjou yaggaay bi ak bariwaay bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1929,"row":{"en":"Some influencers are paid by foreign governments to spread propaganda and disinformation.","wo":"Amna ci yenn influensër yu ay nguur yu bawoo feneen di fay ngir ñuy wéyal seen gis-gis ak di tasaare xibaar bu dul dëgg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmna si yen influenceur you ay ngour you bawo fénéne di fay nguir gnouy wéyal seen guiss-guiss ak di tassaré khibaar bou doul deug.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1930,"row":{"en":"Mother: The telescope is used to look at objects in space.","wo":"Yaay ji: Njariñu telescope mooy xool ay mbir yi kaw asamaan.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYaye dji: Ndiariñou télescope moy khol ay mbir yi kaw as